    Galbot S1 robot description (xacro + COLLADA/STL meshes),
    converted from GalaxyGeneralRobotics/galbot_s1_description.
  </description>
  <maintainer email="mamoru1126@users.noreply.github.com">mamoru1126</maintainer>
  <license>Apache-2.0</license>
